One of the key advantages of AI in trading is its ability to process and analyze massive datasets, identifying patterns that human traders might overlook. For example, natural language processing (NLP) tools can now parse through news articles, social media posts, and earnings calls to gauge market sentiment, which can be a powerful indicator of future price movements.

