### **Operational Adjustments and Strategic Shifts**  

In response to these challenges, Robinhood has made several strategic moves to stabilize its business model. The company recently announced a restructuring plan that includes layoffs, cost-cutting measures, and a shift in focus toward higher-margin services. One of the most notable changes is the introduction of the “Robinhood Gold” subscription model, which offers premium features such as extended trading hours, research tools, and access to fractional shares of stocks and ETFs.  

